 25	 * anything is due. A quiet night costs one jump, not eight hours. The routines, waking windows and
 26	 * night rest stay real, because the sessions read the simulated clock; nothing is accelerated or
 27	 * bypassed, which is the difference from `ai.population.session_interval_seconds`.
 28	 *
